        "endLine": 98
      },
      "anchorHash": "sha256:b1cd99b43caee055a3df7aaff343ab0bea825ee4d3c897f9188a0fe386fadf6c",
      "userNote": "将网页根元素的 data-theme 同步到 Shadow Host，并监听后续变化，让 React 组件能够跟随 LunaTOC 的亮色和暗色主题切换。",
      "createdBy": "user",
      "createdAt": "2026-07-22T11:28:07.521Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-22T11:28:10.431Z"
    }
